// The computer player's definitions, schema version 1 (PLAN.md section 7, M6; docs/DECISIONS.md
// D42, D49).
//
// build_order:  building types in the order the computer player builds them; a type listed n
//               times is kept at n buildings, so lost buildings are rebuilt. A power building is
//               built first whenever the next building would leave the player short of power.
//               Prerequisites come before the buildings that need them, and the producer of
//               each building is a starting building of every faction or comes before it.
// power:        the building type built for power (no prerequisites; its producer is a
//               starting building of every faction)
// harvester:    the harvester unit type (its producer and prerequisites are in build_order)
// army:         armed unit types, produced in this order, cyclically (their producers and
//               prerequisites are in build_order)
// difficulties: id; think_interval (ticks between two decisions, 20 per second);
//               harvesters_per_refinery; max_army (armed units it builds up to); wave_size (armed
//               units at home that start an attack wave); first_wave (the tick from which waves
//               may start); wave_patience (ticks after first_wave or the last wave after which
//               the units at home attack even if fewer than wave_size); defence_radius (visible
//               enemies this many cells from its buildings are attacked by its army at home)
//
// Factions (M7): a computer player builds the entries of build_order and army that its faction's
// roster in skirmish.ron offers, in this order, and skips the others; power and harvester are
// offered by every faction. The Vanguard's plan builds gun turrets and an army of light tanks,
// riflemen, rocket soldiers, artillery, and scouts; the Meridian's rocket towers and heavy tanks,
// conscripts, grenadiers, raiders, and rocket launchers. Balance data (docs/DECISIONS.md D51).
(
    schema_version: 3,
    rules_difficulty: 0,
    policy: (garrison_quota: 0, garrison_radius: 0, depot_radius: 0, naval_rescan: 1, naval_detector_quota: 0, artillery_min_range: 0, artillery_standoff: 0, paradrop_offset: 0, chrono_min_offset: 0, chrono_max_offset: 0),
    plans: [
        (
